_handoff/rw-v2/legs/opus-taste-p0bc.log:29:Two scope corrections worth your attention: the mobile Contents sheet and the unwired `PullQuote`/`ContextualNote`/`ReceiptDisclosure` are **P0-D and V12 work per DIRECTION.md**, not P0-B/C defects, so I put them in a separate section rather than the must-fix list. The dark nav-in-light-theme and the React #418 error reproduce on other essays and are pre-existing site-wide. I also corrected my own draft mid-way: I initially read thread/evidence overlays as unwired, but `focus-host.ts` intercepts by pathname, so they work — and A1 meant my first dark screenshots were unfair, which is why I re-captured.
