_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:318:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:319:# Confidence Check Skill
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:320:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:321:## Purpose
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:322:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:323:Prevents wrong-direction execution by assessing confidence **BEFORE** starting implementation.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:324:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:325:**Requirement**: ≥90% confidence to proceed with implementation.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:326:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:327:**Test Results** (2025-10-21):
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:328:- Precision: 1.000 (no false positives)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:329:- Recall: 1.000 (no false negatives)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:330:- 8/8 test cases passed
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:331:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:332:## When to Use
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:333:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:334:Use this skill BEFORE implementing any task to ensure:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:335:- No duplicate implementations exist
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:336:- Architecture compliance verified
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:337:- Official documentation reviewed
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:338:- Working OSS implementations found
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:339:- Root cause properly identified
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:340:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:341:## Confidence Assessment Criteria
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:342:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:343:Calculate confidence score (0.0 - 1.0) based on 5 checks:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:344:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:345:### 1. No Duplicate Implementations? (25%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:346:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:347:**Check**: Search codebase for existing functionality
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:348:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:349:```bash
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:350:# Use Grep to search for similar functions
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:351:# Use Glob to find related modules
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:352:```
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:353:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:354:✅ Pass if no duplicates found
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:355:❌ Fail if similar implementation exists
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:356:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:357:### 2. Architecture Compliance? (25%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:358:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:359:**Check**: Verify tech stack alignment
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:360:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:361:- Read `CLAUDE.md`, `PLANNING.md`
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:362:- Confirm existing patterns used
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:363:- Avoid reinventing existing solutions
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:364:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:365:✅ Pass if uses existing tech stack (e.g., Supabase, UV, pytest)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:366:❌ Fail if introduces new dependencies unnecessarily
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:367:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:368:### 3. Official Documentation Verified? (20%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:369:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:370:**Check**: Review official docs before implementation
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:371:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:372:- Use Context7 MCP for official docs
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:373:- Use WebFetch for documentation URLs
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:374:- Verify API compatibility
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:375:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:376:✅ Pass if official docs reviewed
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:377:❌ Fail if relying on assumptions
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:378:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:379:### 4. Working OSS Implementations Referenced? (15%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:380:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:381:**Check**: Find proven implementations
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:382:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:383:- Use Tavily MCP or WebSearch
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:384:- Search GitHub for examples
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:385:- Verify working code samples
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:386:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:387:✅ Pass if OSS reference found
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:388:❌ Fail if no working examples
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:389:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:390:### 5. Root Cause Identified? (15%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:391:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:392:**Check**: Understand the actual problem
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:393:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:394:- Analyze error messages
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:395:- Check logs and stack traces
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:396:- Identify underlying issue
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:397:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:398:✅ Pass if root cause clear
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:399:❌ Fail if symptoms unclear
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:400:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:401:## Confidence Score Calculation
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:402:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:403:```
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:404:Total = Check1 (25%) + Check2 (25%) + Check3 (20%) + Check4 (15%) + Check5 (15%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:405:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:406:If Total >= 0.90:  ✅ Proceed with implementation
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:407:If Total >= 0.70:  ⚠️  Present alternatives, ask questions
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:408:If Total < 0.70:   ❌ STOP - Request more context
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:409:```
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:410:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:411:## Output Format
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:412:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:413:```
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:414:📋 Confidence Checks:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:415:   ✅ No duplicate implementations found
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:416:   ✅ Uses existing tech stack
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:417:   ✅ Official documentation verified
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:418:   ✅ Working OSS implementation found
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:419:   ✅ Root cause identified
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:420:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:421:📊 Confidence: 1.00 (100%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:422:✅ High confidence - Proceeding to implementation
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:423:```
