_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:455:3. Mockups: `$H/registry_wave_visual_source_of_truth_2026-09-18/01_CANONICAL_COMPOSITE_MOCKUPS/` (Tier A, visual target), `02_RICH_COMPONENT_DIRECTION/` (component polish only), `03_V2_PROTOTYPE_MARKUPS/` (state semantics). View them with Read; they are the target, not decoration.
