_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:940:### A8. The Evidence Focus index route is a bare list with no `h1`
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:941:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:942:**File:** `src/components/content/EvidenceFocus.astro` — it references only
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:943:`record.id`, `record.title`, `record.evidenceClass`, `record.captureType`.
