_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1412:# Components, data and assets
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1413:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1414:## Component ownership
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1415:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1416:| Component | Home | Behavior / rendering | Implementation priority |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1417:|---|---|---|---|
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1418:| EssayShell / PostLayout | Article route | Owns primary pane, flow intro rail and sticky companion boundary | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1419:| HeroFrontispiece | Entry primary pane | Editorial art, responsive crop, separate OG image | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1420:| EssayHeader / RevisionNote | Entry primary pane | Real metadata; one low-weight revision disclosure | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1421:| ExecutiveSignal / AuthorCard | Entry rail; compact mobile flow | Never sticky, never included in focus layouts | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1422:| SectionMarker | Each major article section | Stable ordinal + current left rule; linked to outline state | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1423:| ReadingCompanion | Article rail | One orientation owner; nearby outline + dock + optional authored note | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1424:| ContextualNote | Article rail / inline mobile | Static authored mapping; manual disclosure/dismissal | P1 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1425:| ThreadScene | Primary pane at six anchors | Canonical text/image/status; real link to focus route | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1426:| ThreadDock | Inside ReadingCompanion | Follow/hold preview; user collapse wins | P1 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1427:| ThreadFocus | Shared focus renderer | Selected beat; details, figure and limits | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1428:| RunningExampleCard | ThreadFocus rail only | Known artifact metadata; unknown fields explicit or omitted | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1429:| ThreadOverview | ThreadFocus rail; mobile navigation | Six real scene links; no article TOC | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1430:| EvidenceFocus | Shared focus renderer | Full evidence set / selected receipt | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1431:| ReceiptDisclosure | Essay summary / EvidenceFocus | Native details; finding and scope always visible | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1432:| EvidenceGuide / ReceiptIndex | EvidenceFocus rail only | Evidence classes and source navigation | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1433:| Figure / FigureViewer | Inline + shared overlay host | Exact art, caption, long description, return context | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1434:| MediaSplit / InlineAside | Defined prose block | Partial primary width, stacks when narrow | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1435:| EditorialTable | Main or focus pane | Semantic table; local horizontal overflow when needed | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1436:| EvidenceLabel / ImplementationStatus | Relevant claims/records | Class and maturity kept separate | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1437:| BoundaryGrid / ManagedVariation | Main pane | Distinct explanatory comparisons, not dashboards | P1 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1438:| WhereThisSits | Closing main pane | Actual cross-series prior/current/next questions | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1439:| SeriesBreadcrumb | Header when true series membership exists | Do not fabricate membership from reading path order | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1440:| MobileContents | User-opened short sheet | Outline + thread navigation; no chatbot or app tab bar | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1441:| FocusHost / NavigationController | One layout-level controller | Owns route-backed inspection and return stack | P0 |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1442:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1443:These are responsibilities, not a mandate for one client framework component each. Reuse existing components where possible. Default to Astro/Markdown/native HTML; no LLM on render, scroll or navigation.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1444:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1445:## Six canonical scenes
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1446:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1447:| ID / anchor | Exact latest filename | Meaning | Placement |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1448:|---|---|---|---|
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1449:| T01 `thread-incident` | `registry_wave_incident_resolution_flow.png` | Source/registry fixed; separate copies stale | Immediately after incident is established |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1450:| T02 `thread-deployment` | `registry_wave_from_source_to_outcome.png` | Same name, different bytes / records | After deployment explanation; anchor image |
