_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1468:The eight canonical technical images are unavailable **here**; this is not evidence they are absent from the user's local system. Local agents must locate exact filenames, pin hashes and inspect full-resolution text. No old variant may be renamed to impersonate a required file.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1469:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1470:## Content field requirements
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1471:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1472:Thread record: ID, label/order, anchor, kind, title, narrative source, canonical figure reference, caption, long description, supported claim, limitations, related receipt IDs.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1473:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1474:Artifact record: stable identity, display title, role/type, public source, version/revision only if supported, optional links and explicit status. Do not create “healthy,” “approved” or “running” from presence alone.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1475:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1476:Receipt record: ID, title, source kind, claim support, limits, independently known event/recorded/verified dates, source locator/revision, capture state, publicability, related scene/paragraph anchors.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1477:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1478:Context note: ID, section/scene scope, short title, one-sentence summary, optional concise body, optional link, dismissal policy. Never assembled by a model at reading time.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1479:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1480:Asset record: exact filename, local availability, approved status, dimensions/hash when measured, semantic role, allowed placements, alt/caption source, supersedes/blocked-by references. A filename or generated composition is not clearance.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1481:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1482:## Specific copy repairs
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1483:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1484:- Restore the manuscript taxonomy: Instruction, Tool, Context, Governance, Execution, Evidence. Do not adopt the mockup's replacement model/data ontology.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1485:- Restore the six scene names. No Create/Publish/Review/Deliver rewrite.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1486:- Keep “instruction present ≠ instruction followed”; do not replace with “presence ≠ provenance” or an implied gateway bypass.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1487:- Delete fabricated metrics, implementation claims, source IDs and customer/production state from every visual.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1488:- Delete “Governed means safe.” Governance makes decisions and scope inspectable; safety requires additional evidence.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1489:- Keep the actual reading path and the planned state of E5.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1490:- Use `nickmiethe.com` for site links; other generated `signal.system` addresses were not source-derived.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1491:- Treat all new prototype paragraphs as layout copy, not an approved essay rewrite.
