_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1494:## 0. How agents should use this pack
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1495:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1496:There are intentionally multiple generations of imagery because they answer different questions.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1497:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1498:- **Canonical composite mockups** answer: *How should the final page, modes, sidebar, and components appear together?*
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1499:- **Rich component direction** answers: *How polished and visually expressive can an individual component become?*
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1500:- **V2 prototype markups** answer: *How should state, navigation, return behavior, modes, and responsive interaction actually work?*
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1501:- **V1 prototype markups** answer: *What earlier layouts/states may still provide useful implementation context?*
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1502:- **Initial style variations** are mood/design exploration only.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1503:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1504:Do not average conflicting references. Follow the precedence order in `README.md`.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1505:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1506:### Content fidelity warning
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1507:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1508:Image-generation text is **not canonical copy**. Some older images deliberately or accidentally contain invented section names, artifact versions, receipts, metrics, product states, or labels. Copy styling and composition—not unsupported content. The current MDX, evidence records, and source-grounded handoff remain authoritative.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1509:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1510:---
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1511:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1512:# 1. Canonical composite mockups — Tier A
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1513:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1514:These nine images are the **primary visual source of truth**.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1515:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1516:| File | What it shows | Implementation authority |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1517:|---|---|---|
