_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1519:| `02_first-scroll__canonical.png` | First substantive scroll, pull quote, active section marker, first inline figure; author/Executive Signal are gone | Canonical mid-essay sidebar state and section-marker treatment |
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1520:| `03_artifact-partial-context__canonical.png` | Partial-width composition, expanded Contextual Note, Editorial Table, active colored left rule | Canonical split-composition and contextual-note pattern |
