_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1588:# 4. V1 prototype markups — Tier D
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1589:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1590:`04_V1_PROTOTYPE_MARKUPS/` contains the earlier full reading-experience wireframes. Keep them for layout archaeology and additional states, especially the six thread beats and earlier mobile experiments.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1591:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1592:They are **not** current authority when they conflict with V2 or Tier A.
