_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1595:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1596:# 5. Initial style variations — Tier E
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1597:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1598:These four early explorations are mood/idea references only.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1599:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1600:- Dark editorial variation — useful typography and section treatment.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1601:- Light editorial variation — useful example of inline components and breathing room.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1602:- Storyboard/dashboard variation — useful source for storyboard density, not final IA.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1603:- Neo-editorial favorite variation — the visual ancestor of the current canonical system.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1604:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1605:Agents may borrow aesthetic details only if they preserve Tier-A composition and V2 semantics.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1606:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1607:---
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1608:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1609:# 6. Inline technical figures are a separate authority
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1610:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1611:The essay's semantic technical figures are not replaced by these page mockups. Follow `06_SUPPORTING_HANDOFFS/INLINE-FIGURE-IMAGE-USAGE-HANDOFF.md` for the latest named technical assets and placement rules.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1612:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1613:That handoff requires the six thread images to remain in order and adjacent to corresponding prose, followed by the managed-variation comparison and closing estate figures when relevant. The mockups show **containers and presentation**, while the inline-figure handoff governs **which technical image is actually inserted**.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1614:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1615:---
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1616:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1617:# 7. Agent implementation checklist
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1618:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1619:Before calling the visual implementation sufficient:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1620:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1621:- [ ] Entry resembles Tier-A `01` in hierarchy, width balance, typography, and spacing.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1622:- [ ] Author + Executive Signal scroll away; they do not persist deep into the article.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1623:- [ ] Reading Companion is the only sticky essay sidebar surface at depth.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1624:- [ ] Active section uses the colored left rule/number treatment without layout shift.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1625:- [ ] Contextual Note is authored marginal context, not chat/AI generation.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1626:- [ ] Dense figures can use primary-pane width and open in FigureViewer.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1627:- [ ] Thread Focus contains only the focused beat plus Running Example + Thread Overview.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1628:- [ ] Thread Focus has explicit `Back to essay` and `Read this scene in essay` semantics.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1629:- [ ] Evidence Focus contains Evidence Guide + Receipt Index, not article TOC.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1630:- [ ] Evidence content comes from real/source-grounded records; generated placeholders are not copied.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1631:- [ ] Managed Variation is inline, not a modal/page.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1632:- [ ] WhereThisSits remains a reading-path component, distinct from series/breadcrumb navigation.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1633:- [ ] Mobile surfaces remain mobile web; no fabricated native-app tab bar/chatbot.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1634:- [ ] FigureViewer returns to the immediate prior context and restores focus.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1635:- [ ] Technical thread images follow the separate canonical image handoff.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:1636:- [ ] Actual current MDX/spec/evidence wins over text shown inside any generated mockup.
