_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2081:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2082:  <script>
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2083:    // Reading progress bar
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2084:    const progressBar = document.getElementById('reading-progress');
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2085:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2086:--- src/components/content/ReadingCompanion.astro ---
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2087:---
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2088:/**
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2089: * ReadingCompanion — the one sticky reading companion for an essay
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2090: * (reading-experience-v2 DIRECTION.md V5, ARCHITECTURE.md §5). Refactor of
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2091: * `PostSidebar.astro` to the three-slot contract from
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2092: * `02_EXPERIENCE_SPEC.md`§6:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2093: *
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2094: *   1. Compact nearby-chapter outline + an "All sections" action.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2095: *   2. `ThreadDock`, when the post has a thread.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2096: *   3. At most one authored `ContextualNote` — skipped for now: no
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2097: *      authored-note data source exists yet, so this slot stays empty
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2098: *      rather than fabricating content (per this leg's build brief).
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2099: *
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2100: * `AuthorProfile` and `ExecutiveSignal` are no longer inside this sticky
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2101: * column at all (V5: they sit in flow at the top of the rail and scroll
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2102: * away) — `PostLayout` renders `AuthorProfile` above this component,
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2103: * outside its sticky wrapper. That removal is also what retires the old
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2104: * accordion between the author card, the takeaway pill, and the thread
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2105: * rail: with only two small, independently-sized blocks left in the
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2106: * column (the outline and the six-item `ThreadDock`), there's no
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2107: * competing-for-space problem left to solve, so this component's script
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2108: * is a straight scroll-spy + windowed-list fit, not an accordion
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2109: * coordinator.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2110: *
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2111: * Posts without a thread get outline-only behavior (the same generic
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2112: * fallback `PostSidebar` provided) — `slug`/`thread` are both optional.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2113: */
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2114:import ThreadDock from './ThreadDock.astro';
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2115:import { threads } from '../../data/threads';
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2116:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2117:interface Heading {
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2118:  depth: number;
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2119:  slug: string;
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2120:  text: string;
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2121:}
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:2122:
