_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:3885:/* Bind Tailwind's `dark:` variant to the site's own `.dark` class instead of
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:3886:   the OS `prefers-color-scheme` media query (reading-experience-v2 FIX-LIST
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:3887:   A1). Without this, every `dark:` utility in the project (370+) is inert
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:3888:   whenever the reader's OS theme disagrees with the theme they picked on the
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:3889:   site. */
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:3890:@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));
