_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:4010:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:4011:  /* Restrained cyan structural accent (reading-experience-v2 DIRECTION V10,
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:4012:     from $H/contracts/design-tokens.css's --cyan). Used sparingly, next to
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:4013:     violet, for mechanism/detection-flavored structure (kind labels, the
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:4014:     figure-viewer chrome) — never as a second primary accent. */
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:4015:  --cyan:           #0e7490;
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1.log:4016:  --cyan-text:      #0e7490;
