_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:149:- Precision: 1.000 (no false positives)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:150:- Recall: 1.000 (no false negatives)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:151:- 8/8 test cases passed
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:152:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:153:## When to Use
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:154:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:155:Use this skill BEFORE implementing any task to ensure:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:156:- No duplicate implementations exist
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:157:- Architecture compliance verified
