_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:162:## Confidence Assessment Criteria
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:163:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:164:Calculate confidence score (0.0 - 1.0) based on 5 checks:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:165:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:166:### 1. No Duplicate Implementations? (25%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:167:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:168:**Check**: Search codebase for existing functionality
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:169:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:170:```bash
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:171:# Use Grep to search for similar functions
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:172:# Use Glob to find related modules
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:173:```
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:174:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:175:✅ Pass if no duplicates found
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:176:❌ Fail if similar implementation exists
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:177:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:178:### 2. Architecture Compliance? (25%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:179:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:180:**Check**: Verify tech stack alignment
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:181:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:182:- Read `CLAUDE.md`, `PLANNING.md`
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:183:- Confirm existing patterns used
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:184:- Avoid reinventing existing solutions
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:185:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:186:✅ Pass if uses existing tech stack (e.g., Supabase, UV, pytest)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:187:❌ Fail if introduces new dependencies unnecessarily
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:188:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:189:### 3. Official Documentation Verified? (20%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:190:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:191:**Check**: Review official docs before implementation
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:192:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:193:- Use Context7 MCP for official docs
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:194:- Use WebFetch for documentation URLs
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:195:- Verify API compatibility
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:196:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:197:✅ Pass if official docs reviewed
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:198:❌ Fail if relying on assumptions
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:199:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:200:### 4. Working OSS Implementations Referenced? (15%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:201:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:202:**Check**: Find proven implementations
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:203:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:204:- Use Tavily MCP or WebSearch
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:205:- Search GitHub for examples
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:206:- Verify working code samples
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:207:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:208:✅ Pass if OSS reference found
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:209:❌ Fail if no working examples
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:210:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:211:### 5. Root Cause Identified? (15%)
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:212:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:213:**Check**: Understand the actual problem
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:214:
