_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:216:- Check logs and stack traces
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:217:- Identify underlying issue
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:218:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:219:✅ Pass if root cause clear
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:220:❌ Fail if symptoms unclear
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:221:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:222:## Confidence Score Calculation
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:223:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:224:```
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/p0d-p1-2.log:225:Total = Check1 (25%) + Check2 (25%) + Check3 (20%) + Check4 (15%) + Check5 (15%)
