_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31620: status: published
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31621: heroImage: "/assets/posts/the-registry-wave-agentic-artifact-supply-chain/hero-governed-cube.png"
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31622: heroAlt: "A shared capability pattern connects several project workbenches, each retaining a distinct adaptation."
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31623:+heroPlacement: frontispiece
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31624: whyItMatters: "Approval attaches to an artifact. Its use happens in a context that approval never saw. A current registry can coexist with stale deployed instructions and unacceptable outcomes."
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31625: leaderTakeaway: "Require four separate assurances: pinned artifact identity, authorized conditions of use, evidence of actual execution, and an accepted outcome. Connect the systems responsible for each."
