_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31947:+ * observer. P1 owns the active-section state; this shell deliberately only
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31948:+ * establishes the stable ordinal and reserved gutter.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:31949:+ */
