h.</p> </div> </aside> </div> <div class="no-scrollbar xl:sticky xl:top-24 xl:max-h-[calc(100vh-7rem)] xl:overflow-y-auto xl:pr-1"> <div class="reading-companion flex flex-col gap-3" data-reading-companion data-astro-cid-ptsvzv4z> <div class="reading-companion__block reading-companion__outline rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-subtle)]" data-companion-outline data-astro-cid-ptsvzv4z> <div class="reading-companion__header font-mono flex items-center justify-between gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--accent)]" data-astro-cid-ptsvzv4z> <span data-astro-cid-ptsvzv4z>On this page</span> <button type="button" class="reading-companion__all-toggle focus-ring text-[var(--text-tertiary)] hover:text-[var(--accent)]" data-companion-all-toggle aria-pressed="false" data-astro-cid-ptsvzv4z>
