_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35741:A3–A9 result:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35742:
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35743:- A3: The desktop rail now uses `xl:self-stretch`, giving the sticky Reading Companion scroll travel.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35744:- A4: The existing “Receipts behind the argument” section now has a real in-flow link to Evidence Focus.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35745:- A5: Added the static `SectionMarker` shell: numbered ordinal, stable gutter, and neutral left rule. It deliberately has no active-section observer or history behavior.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35746:- A6: Enabled `heroPlacement: frontispiece`; moved the hero inside `.post-layout` where `--measure` resolves; explicitly positioned its grid row so it renders above the header.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35747:- A7: Moved `ExecutiveSignal` into the desktop rail under `AuthorProfile`; it remains in flow for narrow layouts where no rail exists.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35748:- A8: Evidence Focus now has an `h1`, opens the first related receipt in full on the essay index, includes a claim badge and receipt date, and lays “What this supports” and “Limits” side by side at wider widths.
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:35749:- A9: Dark figure plates now use a navy panel background while their artwork frames remain light.
