_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:36050:+heroPlacement: frontispiece
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:36051: whyItMatters: "Approval attaches to an artifact. Its use happens in a context that approval never saw. A current registry can coexist with stale deployed instructions and unacceptable outcomes."
_handoff/rw-v2/legs/taste-fix-codex.log:36052: leaderTakeaway: "Require four separate assurances: pinned artifact identity, authorized conditions of use, evidence of actual execution, and an accepted outcome. Connect the systems responsible for each."
